WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.630
"There was no possibility
of taking a walk that day."

2
00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:07.220
So begins the story of
a ten-year-old orphan.

3
00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:08.720
Then a school.

4
00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:12.230
She goes in, and years
later she walks out.

5
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.220
A mansion with battlements.

6
00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:15.920
A house on the moors.

7
00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:17.530
A manor in a wood.

8
00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:18.940
Five homes.

9
00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:21.190
Each time, she moves on.

10
00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:24.040
Why does her story never let her stay?

11
00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:26.920
In this mission, you'll
map all five places,

12
00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:29.480
from Gateshead Hall to Ferndean Manor.

13
00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:33.820
You'll meet the narrator: Jane
herself, grown up, looking back.

14
00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:37.490
And you'll see how she controls
the pace of her own story.

15
00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:41.720
Your mission: explain why Jane's
story keeps moving her on.
